:: Carter Pool Swimming Diving [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Let’s have a diving contest!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> exclaims happily as the two of you are swimming around. He hurries over to the ladder and climbs out, <span style="color:Pink">the wetness of his trunks causing them to sag just a bit and bounce about as he runs over to the grass.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We’ll both run from here and jump and whoever gets the furthest wins!”</span> He says happily, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I was going to say we see who makes the biggest splash, but we’d need a judge for that. So longest jump wins! Are you up to the challenge, or are you scared?”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
