    <<ad _ad>>

You smirk at his proclamation, exiting the pool yourself and running over. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> ties his drawstring the best he can, though knowing him it may not matter, and you both ready yourselves to jump. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright? Ready?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and you both lean down, getting ready to break out running, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Set?”</span> You notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> edging a little bit forward, hoping to get a jump on you despite this being about distance rather than speed. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Go!”</span> <br>
<br>
You both take off running as fast as you can, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> being a little slower, before jumping and diving into the water! <span style="color:Yellow">You hit it a second or two before <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, though can’t tell who got furthest from under the water and hurry to surface with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> right behind you, breaking to the surface with a gasp.</span> <br>
<br>

