    <br>
    You think about arguing the point further <span style="color:Yellow">until you spot a curious piece of red cloth floating in the water nearby.</span> <span style="color:Pink">You smirk, telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> you are willing to admit defeat, but he could at least give you a hug to show no hard feelings. You hold your hands out as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> looks at you none-the-wiser.</span> <br>

